# Build-context filter for ERP/frontend/Dockerfile (context = ERP/frontend/).
#
# The Dockerfile copies named files, never `COPY . .`, so this is defence in
# depth - and it keeps the context small.

# --- Secrets: ERP/frontend/.env holds the real ERP_API_KEY -----------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# --- Node: reinstalled from the lockfile inside the builder ----------------
# A tree installed on Windows can also carry binaries that do not run on linux.
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log*

# --- Build output: produced by the builder, never imported into it ---------
dist/
*.local

# --- Not needed to build or run --------------------------------------------
tests/
**/*.md
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/*.log
